    <briefdescription>
<para>Heuristic LoRA scorer based on query–document token overlap. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses normalised Jaccard similarity over space-split tokens as a proxy for domain relevance. MRR@10 improvement from this scorer is marginal; replace with a real <computeroutput>MultiLoRAManager</computeroutput>-backed scorer for the +5% MRR@10 target. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
